ng", "id": "1608738764262699", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/704976392_1608738767596032_1711235809187454662_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QElUrhRzGKEQ7kNvwFs9jRF&_nc_oc=AdpgCC2c69rfUbPnAGSdPDuN5Hr4B87dLp7qFXdK3OWXOk8-l81_HNJhBIEr3jN55Jg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ35YEZpo7vfeqi5-UDjxpXB-_Ss7Q_vLBDLBy9rJLU_g&oe=6A9D6717"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_3.png", "id": "4395120384148907", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825481_4395120387482240_875473705056262726_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kTnUEmayMugQ7kNvwFz2VF6&_nc_oc=AdomFOgeXGKpuJCOTYYizBjVRAD7q1RL0DV24tl_S3ASHrTwlEEL2s0BTeMdFuFt8J0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKFQJPzQHpS8sDgtMFj0CLSYg7xBViGUCfQKHX5GsTK-w&oe=6A9D87BA"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_4.png", "id": "1541172497658993", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1541172500992326_7866378130643520771_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sD0t3Vim3m8Q7kNvwGeoalr&_nc_oc=Adp0bZJabFm-vGEop_xD7AXcLzbX8gkhXzy9r4xoyBicrhm6lu1RtIik0fxfrtVOaOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK19fcGU3qNUMP9jmzy8HTPBs3fBFopnH8UGpH9aT6owQ&oe=6A9D5E1C"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5.png", "id": "2214609659364045", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_2214609662697378_2687220015106522791_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fH_3olnnBdcQ7kNvwGtlS-I&_nc_oc=AdrDHjDSBirpdojdPZuRJ8s9xtifbPpFBWKBwE8SQn6O09tf9KwJTGhaA1YXMuxKHM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKHFrHkIigtAU0MYut-s5nDrxM63G8oWisA_oTo48la7A&oe=6A9D588C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GSVision Viewer", "keywords": ["gaussian", "splatting", "3d", "photogrammetry", "ply"], "long_description": "# GSVision Viewer\n\nExperience 3D Gaussian Splatting scenes in stunning virtual reality on your Meta Quest 3.\n\n## What is Gaussian Splatting?\n\nGaussian Splatting is a cutting-edge 3D reconstruction technique that creates photorealistic 3D scenes from photos. Unlike traditional 3D models, Gaussian Splats capture real-world environments with incredible detail and lighting accuracy.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Immersive VR viewing** - Walk around and explore 3D scenes in room-scale VR\n- **Intuitive controls** - Easy manipulation with Quest controllers (move, rotate, scale)\n- **High performance** - Optimized rendering for smooth 72 FPS on Quest 3\n- **File browser** - Load your own .ply Gaussian Splat files\n- **Adjustable settings** - Fine-tune splat scale, color saturation, and spherical harmonics order (SH0-SH3)\n- **Advanced rendering** - Full support for view-dependent spherical harmonics (SH0-SH3) for enhanced visual quality\n- **Example scene included** - Start exploring immediately\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Launch the app and complete the quick tutorial\n2. Browse files in `/sdcard/Download/GaussianSplats/` \n3. Point and click to load any .ply file\n4. Use thumbsticks and buttons to navigate and manipulate scenes\n5. Adjust SH order for optimal quality vs. performance balance\n\nPerfect for architects, 3D artists, researchers, and anyone curious about the future of 3D capture technology.", "short_description": "View 3D Gaussian Splats in immersive VR"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1005405368798458", "locale": "pl_PL", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "GSVision Viewer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# GSVision Viewer\n\nOdkryj sceny 3D Gaussian Splatting w niesamowitej wirtualnej rzeczywisto\u015bci na Meta Quest 3.\n\n## Czym jest Gaussian Splatting?\n\nGaussian Splatting to nowoczesna technika rekonstrukcji 3D, kt\u00f3ra tworzy fotorealistyczne sceny 3D na podstawie zdj\u0119\u0107. W przeciwie\u0144stwie do tradycyjnych modeli 3D, Gaussian Splats odwzorowuj\u0105 rzeczywiste otoczenie z niezwyk\u0142\u0105 szczeg\u00f3\u0142owo\u015bci\u0105 i dok\u0142adno\u015bci\u0105 o\u015bwietlenia.\n\n## Funkcje\n\n- **Immersyjne ogl\u0105danie w VR** - Poruszaj si\u0119 i eksploruj sceny 3D w skali pomieszczenia (room-scale VR)\n- **Intuicyjne sterowanie** - \u0141atwa manipulacja za pomoc\u0105 kontroler\u00f3w Quest (przesuwanie, obracanie, skalowanie)\n- **Wysoka wydajno\u015b\u0107** - Zoptymalizowane renderowanie zapewniaj\u0105ce p\u0142ynne 72 FPS na Quest 3\n- **Przegl\u0105darka plik\u00f3w** - Wczytuj w\u0142asne pliki Gaussian Splat w formacie .ply\n- **Regulowane ustawienia** - Precyzyjne dostosowanie skali splat\u00f3w, nasycenia kolor\u00f3w oraz rz\u0119du harmonik sferycznych (SH0-SH3)\n- **Zaawansowane renderowanie** - Pe\u0142na obs\u0142uga zale\u017cnych od k\u0105ta widzenia harmonik sferycznych (SH0-SH3) dla lepszej jako\u015bci wizualnej\n- **Do\u0142\u0105czona scena przyk\u0142adowa** - Rozpocznij eksploracj\u0119 od razu\n\n## Jak korzysta\u0107\n\n1. Uruchom aplikacj\u0119 i przejd\u017a przez kr\u00f3tki samouczek\n2. Przegl\u0105daj pliki w `/sdcard/Download/GaussianSplats/`\n3. Wska\u017c i kliknij, aby wczyta\u0107 dowolny plik .ply\n4. U\u017cywaj dr\u0105\u017ck\u00f3w analogowych i przycisk\u00f3w do nawigacji i manipulacji scenami\n5. Dostosuj rz\u0105d SH, aby uzyska\u0107 optymalny balans mi\u0119dzy jako\u015bci\u0105 a wydajno\u015bci\u0105", "short_description": "Odkryj sceny 3D Gaussian Splatting w niesamowitej wirtualnej rzeczywisto\u015bci na Meta Quest 3."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mt5.foundation/en/gsvision-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MT5 Foundation", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mt5.foundation/en/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "18190